   "title": "Search pickleball venues",
   "description": "Use this when the user wants to find a place to play pickleball, or asks where to play, which courts are near them, or which clubs rent courts, near a city, neighborhood, zip code, venue name, or coordinates. Returns published PickleCourts venues with address, distance, court counts, and whether they can be booked through PickleCourts."
  },
  {
   "name": "find_availability_by_venue",
   "title": "Find court availability at a venue",
   "description": "Use this when the user wants open pickleball court times or prices at a specific venue. Finds requested-duration court rental start times at one published PickleCourts venue on one venue-local date. Use a venue UUID, slug, or name. Prices are USD cents; results include local and UTC times. Each slot carries a booking_url that opens PickleCourts checkout for that exact time."
  },
  {
   "name": "find_availability_by_region",
   "title": "Find court availability in a region",
   "description": "Use this when the user wants any open court in a city on a date and has not picked a venue, or asks what pickleball courts are open or bookable today, tonight, or this weekend. Finds court rental availability across published venues in one PickleCourts city or metro region for one local calendar date. Use a region UUID, slug, or name. Results are bounded and sorted by earliest time and price. Each slot carries a booking_url that opens PickleCourts checkout for that exact time."
  }
